WEBVTT

00:02.820 --> 00:05.230
<i>I worked as a salaryman 
for a toxic company,</i>

00:05.230 --> 00:07.050
<i>until I reincarnated...</i>

00:07.050 --> 00:11.150
<i>in a crazy world where everything is 
dropped by monsters in dungeons.</i>

00:11.630 --> 00:16.390
<i>In my new life, I'm level 1, 
but I have a unique skill</i>

00:16.390 --> 00:18.620
<i>that puts all of my drop rates at rank S.</i>

00:19.170 --> 00:20.880
<i>And today I'm...</i>

00:21.240 --> 00:26.320
<i>being hugged by a mummy, hassled by 
a hot guy, and swarmed by bugs!</i>

00:26.320 --> 00:28.910
<i>Wait, none of that is any good at all!</i>

00:36.140 --> 00:45.270
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

02:00.010 --> 02:05.020
<b>Yay! It's My Turn Now</b>

02:20.780 --> 02:22.680
It's coming along great!

02:23.560 --> 02:25.920
<i>I'm enjoying my life very much.</i>

02:27.050 --> 02:28.830
<i>Are you watching?</i>

02:30.620 --> 02:33.540
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

02:36.770 --> 02:40.250
First skeletons, then zombies, 
and now mummies?

02:40.250 --> 02:42.770
That one sure was tough, though.

02:45.210 --> 02:47.810
My bullets... Oh.

02:51.840 --> 02:54.190
<i>Ryota's speed increased by one.</i>

02:51.940 --> 02:54.190
m 3 0 l 265 0 l 268 3 l 268 22 l 265 25 l 3 25 l 0 22 l 0 3

02:51.940 --> 02:54.190
Ryota's speed increased by 1.

02:55.850 --> 02:57.550
Speed, huh?

02:59.870 --> 03:01.970
Hey! Get off me!

03:11.620 --> 03:15.670
Oh, right. Since my strength's at S...

03:15.970 --> 03:18.740
Looks like I'm better off using these here.

03:20.220 --> 03:21.840
<b>Will</b>

03:20.220 --> 03:21.840
<b>Speed</b>

03:20.220 --> 03:21.840
<b>Dexterity</b>

03:29.360 --> 03:30.250
Hi.

03:31.630 --> 03:33.800
You're Ryota Sato, right?

03:39.300 --> 03:40.360
Who're you?

03:40.360 --> 03:42.500
Oh, sorry. I'm—

03:43.110 --> 03:45.110
Is this the guy, Nep?

03:45.110 --> 03:46.600
Yep, seems to be.

03:47.190 --> 03:49.860
Huh... So this is him.

03:53.690 --> 03:55.660
<i>Just who is this guy?</i>

03:55.660 --> 03:58.400
<i>Good-looking, with a cute 
girl on each arm...</i>

03:58.960 --> 04:02.120
And... what did you want from me?

04:02.120 --> 04:04.730
I wanted to arm wrestle you.

04:04.730 --> 04:07.290
Huh? Why arm wrestle?

04:07.810 --> 04:10.320
I'm interested in your power.

04:11.170 --> 04:12.260
I've heard...

04:13.330 --> 04:16.250
that you put on quite the
 show here recently.

04:16.550 --> 04:17.700
Oh...

04:23.830 --> 04:26.560
What do you say to a match with me?

04:27.210 --> 04:31.170
<i>He's hot, he has cute girls hanging 
on him, </i>and<i> he's confident?!</i>

04:31.170 --> 04:34.120
<i>Hang on! I can't just let this guy slide!</i>

04:36.260 --> 04:38.340
All right. Let's do it.

04:38.340 --> 04:39.570
Thanks.

04:40.900 --> 04:43.060
Well, shall we?

04:43.420 --> 04:44.500
Sure.

04:44.500 --> 04:45.780
Ready...

04:46.130 --> 04:46.940
Go!

04:49.010 --> 04:51.460
<i>This guy's... strong!</i>

05:05.950 --> 05:09.380
No way! Neptune lost?

05:06.820 --> 05:08.370
What?!

05:08.370 --> 05:10.360
Nep actually lost?

05:12.180 --> 05:14.100
You're really something!

05:14.900 --> 05:16.450
Yeah, same to you.

05:19.320 --> 05:21.520
<i>Oh, that's right! He's...</i>

05:21.820 --> 05:23.630
Neptune?

05:23.630 --> 05:25.240
You don't know them?

05:25.240 --> 05:28.110
They're the most powerful 
organization in Secro.

05:28.850 --> 05:30.630
<i>Neptune?</i>

05:30.630 --> 05:31.400
Hey.

05:32.170 --> 05:33.890
Want to go one more round?

05:35.190 --> 05:39.320
No, thanks. We've made enough 
of a scene already.

05:39.320 --> 05:40.490
Aw...

05:41.260 --> 05:44.320
Well, so it goes. In that case...

05:55.510 --> 05:57.830
Hey! What were you thinking?!

05:58.300 --> 06:01.220
Wow, you're not half bad!

06:06.730 --> 06:08.910
Yeah. I like you.

06:09.560 --> 06:13.010
Would you be interested 
in joining our family?

06:13.470 --> 06:14.220
What?

06:14.220 --> 06:15.320
For real?

06:15.320 --> 06:17.490
He got scouted by the Neptune family?

06:17.490 --> 06:19.810
And by the leader himself!

06:22.030 --> 06:24.570
What?! You turned him down?!

06:24.810 --> 06:28.510
Yeah. I have no interest in 
belonging to any groups.

06:30.220 --> 06:34.330
I have more fun just living here with you.

06:34.780 --> 06:35.950
This is where I feel best.

06:37.140 --> 06:40.620
I'm so happy to hear you say that.

06:42.110 --> 06:44.630
You're very cocky for a low-level.

06:45.620 --> 06:47.300
Wait, you're here?!

06:48.520 --> 06:53.000
It really is amazing that 
he scouted you, though!

06:53.420 --> 06:57.720
It must be because you've 
helped so many people.

06:58.930 --> 07:01.650
You're a hero, Yoda!

07:04.570 --> 07:08.490
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

07:08.500 --> 07:11.840
A hero? I'm a hero, huh?

07:11.840 --> 07:13.570
Hey, we meet again.

07:13.570 --> 07:15.300
Oh... huh?

07:16.710 --> 07:18.310
Are those boxes...

07:18.310 --> 07:19.740
Oh, you saw these?

07:19.980 --> 07:24.160
This is our company's latest product, 
the Pandora's Box!

07:24.160 --> 07:25.840
Pandora's Box?

07:25.840 --> 07:28.950
Yes, and you came at
 the right time. Look.

07:35.640 --> 07:39.100
It automatically sucks up dropped items,

07:39.100 --> 07:43.090
and even displays the face of 
the person who found them!

07:45.370 --> 07:48.380
There are a few folks who 
don't believe our air

07:48.380 --> 07:50.220
was really harvested by the princess.

07:50.670 --> 07:53.080
We came up with these to fix that.

07:53.440 --> 07:55.730
You're an adventurer, aren't you?

07:56.590 --> 07:58.770
I'll give you a few. Use them well.

07:59.450 --> 08:01.620
And tell your friends about them!

08:02.600 --> 08:05.340
Uh, I don't know if I need this many...

08:06.150 --> 08:10.490
Wait, if they automatically 
suck up all dropped items...

08:13.710 --> 08:15.490
I was right!

08:15.490 --> 08:19.070
If I use this, I can take the 
seeds outside the dungeon!

08:19.780 --> 08:21.630
And if I can take them out...

08:35.790 --> 08:39.830
I went through hell to get freezing 
bullets, and this makes it so easy!

08:40.700 --> 08:41.580
No...

08:43.140 --> 08:44.140
Hang on.

08:44.810 --> 08:49.940
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

08:48.260 --> 08:49.940
<i>If I have this box...</i>

09:01.220 --> 09:02.810
Yoda?

09:02.810 --> 09:04.400
Oh, Emily.

09:04.740 --> 09:07.300
Um, what are you doing?

09:08.900 --> 09:10.320
Here they come!

09:12.780 --> 09:14.330
What?!

09:15.000 --> 09:17.180
<i>I knew it! It worked!</i>

09:24.330 --> 09:26.450
Yes! There they are!

09:31.040 --> 09:33.780
<i>Ryota acquired a fire bullet.</i>

09:33.780 --> 09:37.200
A fire bullet! So fire comes after ice!

09:38.020 --> 09:41.130
And what's this one from the mummy?

09:42.200 --> 09:44.320
Um, Yoda?

09:44.550 --> 09:46.550
What just happened?

09:47.320 --> 09:48.530
This is...

09:49.160 --> 09:51.770
I can use these! I gotta get more!

09:53.630 --> 09:55.670
Check out all these special bullets!

09:55.670 --> 09:57.230
Amazing!

09:57.230 --> 09:59.370
All right, now for the last—

10:02.050 --> 10:03.560
What's wrong?

10:03.560 --> 10:06.380
I just felt a really powerful chill...

10:06.380 --> 10:07.700
A chill?

10:08.020 --> 10:12.760
Oh! I forgot! That's what 
I came to tell you!

10:12.760 --> 10:13.620
Huh?

10:13.860 --> 10:17.000
Yoda, a magic storm is coming!

10:17.000 --> 10:18.540
A magic storm?

10:25.970 --> 10:29.390
Um... is Emily not with you today?

10:29.390 --> 10:32.780
O-Oh... She had some shopping to do,

10:32.780 --> 10:34.740
so we're working separately today.

10:35.060 --> 10:38.910
I-I see. It is a magic storm, after all.

10:40.000 --> 10:43.360
Does a magic storm have anything 
to do with shopping?

10:43.360 --> 10:46.670
Y-Yes, I think it does.

10:46.670 --> 10:51.290
Are you telling me you don't know 
know what a magic storm is?

10:51.540 --> 10:55.710
Yeah, actually... Emily mentioned it to me,

10:55.710 --> 10:58.250
but she didn't know much, either.

10:58.580 --> 11:01.860
Could you tell me what they're all about?

11:01.860 --> 11:05.140
Of course! Leave it to me!

11:05.140 --> 11:10.990
A magic storm is a very 
rare natural phenomenon.

11:10.990 --> 11:15.140
When they occur, no one 
can use any magic at all.

11:15.470 --> 11:17.470
You can't use magic?

11:17.950 --> 11:21.520
Right. And depending on how big they are, 
their effects can go beyond the town.

11:21.520 --> 11:24.010
You might not be able to use
 magic in dungeons, either.

11:24.010 --> 11:25.890
Not even in dungeons?

11:27.170 --> 11:32.450
And this magic storm is a big one 
that will affect dungeons, too.

11:32.450 --> 11:36.540
So all those who use magic 
are taking the day off.

11:37.290 --> 11:42.080
That leads to reduced availability of 
drops from dungeons intended for them,

11:42.080 --> 11:45.510
which affects how people shop.

11:45.790 --> 11:47.580
I see.

11:47.580 --> 11:49.550
Someone help! Please!

11:51.510 --> 11:52.650
Help!

11:53.860 --> 11:55.350
Rosa...

11:55.350 --> 11:58.090
My partner's been left behind in Silicon!

12:01.730 --> 12:02.980
Reyes!

12:04.180 --> 12:05.500
What's Silicon?

12:05.860 --> 12:09.240
One of the dungeons intended 
for magic users.

12:09.240 --> 12:12.250
What? Weren't all magic 
users taking the day off?

12:10.810 --> 12:13.720
Please help me! I beg you!

12:12.250 --> 12:15.100
Reyes and Rosa just came to Secro recently.

12:14.290 --> 12:15.100
Please!

12:15.100 --> 12:19.160
I think they must have found out
 about the magic storm too late.

12:27.010 --> 12:29.230
Hey, why won't anyone...

12:29.660 --> 12:31.040
Tragic, isn't it?

12:32.680 --> 12:35.860
Don't show up out of nowhere! 
Why <i>are</i> you here, anyway?!

12:36.060 --> 12:38.490
I thought maybe you'd changed your mind.

12:39.140 --> 12:40.700
I have not!

12:40.700 --> 12:42.260
Well, that's a shame.

12:42.700 --> 12:43.670
Still...

12:44.270 --> 12:46.800
Of all places, it had to be Silicon...

12:47.400 --> 12:49.470
What do you mean?

12:49.860 --> 12:52.990
The monsters there are a real pain.

12:53.670 --> 12:56.040
Even I don't want to go near it.

12:56.580 --> 12:57.800
Even you?

12:58.280 --> 13:03.210
The monsters in Silicon take nearly 
no damage from non-magical attacks.

13:03.660 --> 13:06.710
So they have my condolences,

13:06.710 --> 13:10.320
but I can't put my life on the 
line for a complete stranger.

13:11.460 --> 13:14.100
You're a hero, Yoda!

13:17.450 --> 13:21.000
Please... Somebody help me... Please...

13:21.690 --> 13:22.740
Hey.

13:24.450 --> 13:25.770
I'll go.

13:26.480 --> 13:28.340
Tell me what's going on.

13:30.030 --> 13:32.160
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:30.030 --> 13:32.160
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:32.750 --> 13:34.060
It was me, Eyna!

13:35.040 --> 13:36.830
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:35.040 --> 13:36.830
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:35.370 --> 13:37.350
Whatcha doing, Erza?

13:36.540 --> 13:38.100
It smells like Ryota...

13:38.100 --> 13:40.050
Please use responsibly.

13:44.470 --> 13:48.890
<b>Silicon Level 1</b>

13:49.620 --> 13:53.190
Level 3. That's where Rosa should be.

14:00.890 --> 14:02.260
That's a fire bullet!

14:09.640 --> 14:10.740
All right!

14:16.120 --> 14:18.680
That should stop it from 
turning into a stray.

14:20.440 --> 14:23.130
I can still use my special bullets 
during the magic storm.

14:23.130 --> 14:24.290
This'll work!

14:24.290 --> 14:26.470
I can save her!

14:29.680 --> 14:31.460
There are so many of them.

14:32.750 --> 14:33.840
But...

14:35.990 --> 14:38.530
Yoda, sorry to keep you waiting!

14:39.410 --> 14:40.930
Emily!

14:40.930 --> 14:42.000
Yes?

14:42.430 --> 14:45.110
Wait, isn't that Yoda's...

14:45.110 --> 14:47.870
Mr. Sato is in a bit of a situation.

14:48.550 --> 14:50.870
What?! Yoda's in trouble?!

14:52.280 --> 14:56.700
<b>Silicon Level 3</b>

14:57.530 --> 14:58.810
This is the place.

15:00.450 --> 15:02.040
Already?!

15:12.180 --> 15:14.450
Rosa! Where are you?!

15:20.740 --> 15:22.010
Rosa!

15:25.720 --> 15:27.010
This looks bad.

15:27.490 --> 15:29.300
Hang tight! I'll—

15:30.790 --> 15:32.370
This is not the time!

15:34.690 --> 15:35.970
Are you kidding me?!

15:36.480 --> 15:37.840
My special bullets...

15:38.990 --> 15:41.040
Hey! Silicon is that way!

15:41.040 --> 15:42.720
Don't go there! It's dangerous!

15:43.120 --> 15:45.820
I'm afraid we have no choice!

15:45.820 --> 15:46.540
I get it.

15:46.940 --> 15:49.220
Low-Level's carrots are important.

15:49.750 --> 15:52.880
No, that's not exactly why...

15:53.450 --> 15:54.420
Why, then?

15:55.230 --> 15:57.740
Because Yoda reminds me of...

15:58.780 --> 16:00.620
my mother!

16:09.460 --> 16:11.770
That was amazing, Mom!

16:11.770 --> 16:15.210
Well, that's how I handle things.

16:17.310 --> 16:18.900
You guys okay?

16:19.300 --> 16:20.690
Y-Yeah...

16:22.280 --> 16:26.620
You need to understand what you're 
capable of before taking on a dungeon.

16:26.620 --> 16:30.050
Otherwise, you don't stand a chance.

16:30.050 --> 16:31.320
Yes, ma'am...

16:31.320 --> 16:34.340
Okay, that's enough lecturing for now.

16:35.940 --> 16:38.700
Time to live it up! Yeah?

16:39.430 --> 16:41.260
<i>If she ever found someone in trouble,</i>

16:41.260 --> 16:44.080
<i>she'd help them, lecture them, 
and then have fun with them.</i>

16:44.510 --> 16:48.160
<i>My mother was both strong and kind.</i>

16:50.230 --> 16:52.360
<i>But one day...</i>

16:55.610 --> 16:57.080
What's wrong?

16:57.080 --> 16:58.540
You'd better run, too!

16:58.540 --> 17:01.360
There's a dragon! It's a stray!

17:05.310 --> 17:06.670
Mom?

17:07.750 --> 17:11.040
Don't worry. Everything's fine, Emily.

17:11.450 --> 17:15.860
I'll take care of this. 
You escape with the others.

17:16.300 --> 17:17.300
All right?

17:17.740 --> 17:19.670
O-Okay...

17:29.650 --> 17:31.150
Mom!

17:31.900 --> 17:33.470
Mom!

17:34.360 --> 17:36.120
Don't make a fuss.

17:37.490 --> 17:38.590
Are the others safe?

17:40.260 --> 17:43.070
They're all fine!

17:43.930 --> 17:45.070
Oh?

17:47.250 --> 17:48.980
I'm glad.

17:51.010 --> 17:54.860
Don't cry. The time for 
that will come later.

17:55.260 --> 17:56.030
Huh?

17:58.610 --> 18:02.330
Take me out of here. Get me to the others.

18:03.600 --> 18:08.170
That way, none of my belongings 
will turn into strays.

18:08.850 --> 18:10.140
Can you do that?

18:13.240 --> 18:14.230
Yes.

18:15.860 --> 18:20.350
Will you continue going 
into dungeons after this?

18:23.960 --> 18:25.700
Don't be reckless.

18:26.480 --> 18:30.650
Not just for yourself... 
but for everyone...

18:33.090 --> 18:35.990
<i>She was concerned for everyone 
else right up to the end.</i>

18:38.810 --> 18:41.040
<i>My mother was a hero.</i>

18:57.770 --> 18:59.550
<i>Yoda is the same way!</i>

19:01.080 --> 19:05.370
<i>He's done so much to help so many people.</i>

19:05.770 --> 19:09.480
<i>So now it's my turn to help him!</i>

19:22.100 --> 19:24.690
Regular bullets just aren't cutting it!

19:25.040 --> 19:26.500
Yoda!

19:26.850 --> 19:28.370
Emily?! Wait...

19:31.780 --> 19:34.430
What?! Why are there zombies?!

19:34.430 --> 19:38.910
We'll take care of her! 
You handle the strays!

19:38.910 --> 19:40.620
We brought more bullets for you!

19:43.610 --> 19:46.960
You're both lifesavers, Emily, Eve!

19:55.350 --> 19:56.920
I'll take it from here!

20:05.630 --> 20:06.670
Rosa!

20:08.090 --> 20:09.460
She's hurt badly...

20:09.460 --> 20:13.700
And I can't use healing magic during 
the magic storm! What do I do?

20:14.630 --> 20:16.700
No need to worry about that.

20:16.970 --> 20:17.730
Huh?

20:29.520 --> 20:30.860
What was that?

20:30.860 --> 20:32.120
A healing bullet.

20:34.580 --> 20:37.300
<i>Ryota acquired a healing bullet.</i>

20:38.320 --> 20:39.650
This is...

20:40.520 --> 20:43.810
I didn't have time to 
use it in the dungeon.

20:51.570 --> 20:52.610
Rosa!

20:53.380 --> 20:56.890
Thank you! Thank you so much!

21:05.370 --> 21:07.700
I'm glad we were able to save her.

21:14.710 --> 21:19.210
By the way, Emily, I'm impressed 
you had the idea to do that.

21:19.700 --> 21:22.110
It wasn't a big deal.

21:24.300 --> 21:26.910
I just imitated what I've seen you do.

21:31.560 --> 21:33.680
You really saved my skin.

21:33.680 --> 21:37.010
Thanks, Emily. And you, too, Eve.

21:37.010 --> 21:38.970
Carrots before thanks.

21:38.970 --> 21:42.120
Okay, want to get something 
to eat before we go home?

21:42.120 --> 21:43.880
You all must be tired.

21:45.400 --> 21:47.660
We should head back home, then.

21:48.210 --> 21:52.040
Huh? But that'll mean you have to cook.

21:52.410 --> 21:54.450
That's exactly why!

21:54.450 --> 21:55.150
Huh?

21:55.360 --> 21:56.290
Huh?

22:00.000 --> 22:02.470
<i>I'm enjoying my life very much.</i>

22:03.770 --> 22:07.590
<i>Are you watching, Mom?</i>
